        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"8eafa340-0880-4a18-a067-e3815a3a06b7\",\"review_text\":\"I love it😻\"},{\"review_id\":\"2aa2ed9c-cdef-408f-8acc-c4feea36232a\",\"review_text\":\"Garbage. The new advertising breaks are three times louder than Joe Rogan. I'll manage life without Spotify and Joe.\"},{\"review_id\":\"5dc150c8-9887-41f2-8e0e-0717d01c91fc\",\"review_text\":\"Cool 🖤\"},{\"review_id\":\"164025d8-7ce3-4037-99ea-9847ffa310b5\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely loved this app, untill the recent update where you can't scroll freely and need to pay to see the lyrics. Y'all are ruining the app and it's fanbase. Congratulations.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c64801b6-65b5-4d00-b43c-1eff39dbdf33\",\"review_text\":\"Yall need to chill out on the advertisements yo. Seriously. I'm getting 8 - 12 advertisements every 2 songs!\"},{\"review_id\":\"50140fb4-b7de-4c35-b2aa-3a5c4ad21f99\",\"review_text\":\"The latest update is against ethics\"},{\"review_id\":\"4799d5ef-abf1-4a61-a5eb-9f60c86a565c\",\"review_text\":\"Bro All Is Good but now my spotify is not working it only Show black screen only can anyone help me to. Solve this problem 🙏🙏\"},{\"review_id\":\"6338de2f-a10c-4692-b9fc-0e76b9fdb21a\",\"review_text\":\"Have been using Spotify for a couple of years now. But not any more. Very disappointed with the latest update. Scrapped all the basic features.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2009b201-5bac-4013-80b2-d48f8e6f3c99\",\"review_text\":\"I love your Vidos .\"},{\"review_id\":\"a02896cb-9b92-4c67-9252-4b006bed3ef5\",\"review_text\":\"Bed aap west time\"}]}"
